                              "fill": "$muted",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 360,
                              "content": "What happens when you can no longer trust your own eyes? This project examines how the cognitive challenges of identifying deepfake news affects our sense of self and our vulnerability to further disinformation.",
