                      "name": "Core introduction",
                      "fill": "$ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 342,
                      "content": "Hello! My name is Sukyoung Choi. I am an Assistant Professor in the Department of Communication at Yonsei University. My research investigates the intersection of emerging communication technologies (such as AI and online games) and their psychological and societal impacts, with an emphasis on quantitative methods.",
